[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_STEAM]
Try Again

[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_STEAM_desc]
The twins are back, and this time they have some new ideas. Would you like to hear them again?\nYes, they have scammed us before. And, yes, they have sold us low quality juice. But this time, they say they will not participate in the production.\nThey just want us to understand the concept of “steam engine”.

[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_STEAM_BONUS]
Las Pegasus’s Paid Sharing

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_STEAM]
